A(r"The near-zero SHAP-seed SD for S* is not a bug: S* was LR in most folds, and permutation SHAP is almost exact for a model that is nearly additive on the probability scale, because every permutation then yields almost the same marginal contributions; the residual variation for HE reflects its interactions.")
